  "caption": "Quinn's new-year plan was the gym at 5am every day. By week two, the gym bag had become a doorstop.\n\nThe best exercise is often the one you'll keep doing. Motivation comes and goes, so enjoyment, convenience and routine usually matter more than finding the perfect program.\n\nThings that often help: choose something you actually like, start below your limit and build gradually, add a class or a training buddy, attach it to an existing routine, and keep a 15-minute fallback for busy weeks. If something isn't working after a fair go, swap it.\n\nIf pain or a health condition keeps stopping you, make it part of the plan and get individual advice.\n\nOur Sydney CBD and Chatswood physios can help. Book via the link in bio.\n\nGeneral information only — not a substitute for an individual assessment.",
